            "title": "國際｜都柏林晚宴場地附近檢獲爆炸裝置 拆彈專家到場處理",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"國際｜都柏林晚宴場地附近檢獲爆炸裝置 拆彈專家到場處理\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"502\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e6cd3d35aab14a9b84d896addee28a7e5bc9c3f7f11e8c3427e591e579b8360d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">國際｜都柏林晚宴場地附近檢獲爆炸裝置 拆彈專家到場處理</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">愛爾蘭警方在都柏林市中心梅里恩廣場一幢辦公大樓內檢獲一枚具備引爆能力的簡易爆炸裝置，並由軍方拆彈專家到場安全處理。發現地點鄰近愛爾蘭國家美術館，該館前一晚舉行歐洲政治共同體領導人會議晚宴，法國總統馬克龍、英國首相貝安德及加拿大總理卡尼等多名領袖出席。當局正調查事件，未披露裝置何時被人放置等細節。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Subscribe FORTUNE INSIGHT Telegram: <br/><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:http://bit.ly/2M63TRO;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">http://bit.ly/2M63TRO</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Subscribe FORTUNE INSIGHT YouTube channel:<br/><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"http://bit.ly/2FgJTen\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:http://bit.ly/2FgJTen;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"http://bit.ly/2FgJTen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">http://bit.ly/2FgJTen</a></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B-%E9%83%BD%E6%9F%8F%E6%9E%97%E6%99%9A%E5%AE%B4%E5%A0%B4%E5%9C%B0%E9%99%84%E8%BF%91%E6%AA%A2%E7%8D%B2%E7%88%86%E7%82%B8%E8%A3%9D%E7%BD%AE-%E6%8B%86%E5%BD%88%E5%B0%88%E5%AE%B6%E5%88%B0%E5%A0%B4%E8%99%95%E7%90%86-070031900.html",
